	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Rackstad museum</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			Rackstadmuseet is built around sculptor Christian Eriksson's childhood home in Arvika, and
			tells the story of the <strong>Rackstad Colony</strong> — Sweden's foremost artist colony
			from the turn of the last century. Painters and craftspeople including Gustaf Fjæstad,
			Christian Eriksson, and Björn Ahlgrensson settled around nearby Lake Racken, drawn by much
			the same Värmland landscape you're looking at from the farm.
		</p>
		<p>
			Usually paired with a stop in <a href="/activities/klassbol">Klässbol</a>, a few minutes
			further down the road.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
